# Chat persistence directory
#
# This directory stores all runtime data that must survive app rebuilds:
#   - webui.db          SQLite database (all chat history, users, settings)
#   - uploads/          User-uploaded files
#   - cache/            Application cache (tiktoken, etc.)
#   - desktop-webview/  Browser profile for the desktop launcher (auth tokens)
#   - desktop-server.log  Server log (ignored in .gitignore)
#
# Persistence across builds:
#   - Docker:    Mount a volume at /app/backend/data (see docker-compose.yaml)
#   - Desktop:   Data lives here automatically (desktop/app.py)
#   - Local dev: Data lives here automatically (backend/qwythos/env.py)
#
# Do NOT commit the contents of this directory — it contains private user data.
